<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>

<!--
	Badge demo: a count from the model at a button, an avatar, a tab of a tab bar and - in the sidebar
	of the application - at the navigation item leading here.

	The openTickets channel counts the open tickets. It reads no channel, so the type it counts is
	named as an observed type: a ticket created, closed or deleted - here, on the page of the tickets
	or in another session - recomputes the count, and every badge follows it. The "Open tickets" tab
	lists the open tickets: "New ticket" (the button above and the toolbar of the list) creates one,
	the form below the list changes its status, and "Delete" removes it.

	The number field overrides the count for trying the rules of a badge: 0 shows no badge, a number
	above 99 shows "99+", an empty field shows the count of the open tickets again. The checkbox
	writes true or false to the marked channel, which shows a dot - a mark without a count, named by
	its badge-label ("New entries") for a screen reader - or nothing.

	The roles: the button counts in the role error, the avatar in the role of the brand, the tab of the
	open tickets in the role warning, and the dot is a success.
-->
<view>
	<channels>
		<channel name="ticket"/>
		<derived-channel name="openTickets"
			expr="all(`demo.tickets:Ticket`).filter(t -> $t.get(`demo.tickets:Ticket#status`) == `demo.tickets:TicketStatus#open`).size()"
			observed-types="demo.tickets:Ticket"
		/>
		<channel name="trialCount"/>
		<derived-channel name="badgeCount"
			expr="if($trial == null, $open, $trial)"
			inputs="openTickets as open, trialCount as trial"
		/>
		<channel name="marked"/>
		<derived-channel name="person"
			expr="currentUser()"
		/>
	</channels>

	<panel with-inset="true">
		<title>
			<en>Badges</en>
			<de>Badges</de>
		</title>

		<stack gap="default">
			<text>
				<label>
					<en>The badges below count the open tickets: create a ticket, close one in the form of the list or delete it, and every badge follows - also the one at the "Badges" item in the sidebar. To try the rules of a badge, enter a number: 0 shows no badge, a number above 99 shows "99+". An empty field shows the count of the open tickets again. The checkbox marks the page with a dot.</en>
					<de>Die Badges unten zählen die offenen Tickets: Legen Sie ein Ticket an, schließen Sie eines im Formular der Liste oder löschen Sie es, und jedes Badge folgt - auch das am Eintrag „Badges“ in der Seitenleiste. Um die Regeln eines Badges auszuprobieren, geben Sie eine Zahl ein: 0 zeigt kein Badge, eine Zahl über 99 zeigt „99+“. Ein leeres Feld zeigt wieder die Zahl der offenen Tickets. Das Kontrollkästchen markiert die Seite mit einem Punkt.</de>
				</label>
			</text>

			<stack
				align="end"
				direction="row"
				gap="default"
			>
				<value-input
					type="tl.core:Integer"
					value="trialCount"
				>
					<label>
						<en>Count to show</en>
						<de>Angezeigte Zahl</de>
					</label>
					<placeholder>
						<en>Open tickets</en>
						<de>Offene Tickets</de>
					</placeholder>
				</value-input>
				<value-input
					type="tl.core:Boolean"
					value="marked"
				>
					<label>
						<en>Mark with a dot</en>
						<de>Mit Punkt markieren</de>
					</label>
				</value-input>
			</stack>

			<stack
				align="center"
				direction="row"
				gap="default"
			>
				<button>
					<action class="com.top_logic.layout.view.command.GenericViewCommand"
						badge="badgeCount"
						badge-role="error"
						image="css:bi bi-plus-lg"
					>
						<label>
							<en>New ticket</en>
							<de>Neues Ticket</de>
						</label>
						<create-transient type="demo.tickets:Ticket">
							<with-result>
								<open-dialog
									bind-input-to="model"
									dialog-view="tickets-create.view.xml"
								/>
							</with-result>
						</create-transient>
					</action>
				</button>
				<button appearance="ghost">
					<action class="com.top_logic.layout.view.command.GenericViewCommand"
						badge="marked"
						badge-role="success"
						display="icon-only"
						image="css:bi bi-bell"
					>
						<label>
							<en>Notifications</en>
							<de>Benachrichtigungen</de>
						</label>
						<badge-label>
							<en>New entries</en>
							<de>Neue Einträge</de>
						</badge-label>
					</action>
				</button>
				<avatar
					badge="badgeCount"
					input="person"
				>
					<badge-label>
						<en>Open tickets</en>
						<de>Offene Tickets</de>
					</badge-label>
				</avatar>
			</stack>

			<tab-bar active-tab="open">
				<tab id="open"
					badge="badgeCount"
					badge-role="warning"
				>
					<label>
						<en>Open tickets</en>
						<de>Offene Tickets</de>
					</label>
					<stack gap="default">
						<panel>
							<title>
								<en>Open tickets</en>
								<de>Offene Tickets</de>
							</title>
							<commands>
								<generic-command
									image="css:bi bi-plus-lg"
									placement="TOOLBAR"
								>
									<label>
										<en>New ticket</en>
										<de>Neues Ticket</de>
									</label>
									<create-transient type="demo.tickets:Ticket">
										<with-result>
											<open-dialog
												bind-input-to="model"
												dialog-view="tickets-create.view.xml"
											/>
										</with-result>
									</create-transient>
								</generic-command>
								<generic-command
									image="css:bi bi-trash"
									inputs="ticket"
									placement="TOOLBAR"
								>
									<label>
										<en>Delete</en>
										<de>Löschen</de>
									</label>
									<executability>
										<null-input-disabled/>
									</executability>
									<delete-object/>
									<write-channel name="ticket"
										clear="true"
									/>
								</generic-command>
							</commands>
							<table
								observed-types="demo.tickets:Ticket"
								selection="ticket"
								types="demo.tickets:Ticket"
							>
								<columns>
									<column attribute="name"/>
									<column attribute="status"/>
								</columns>
								<rows>all(`demo.tickets:Ticket`).filter(t -&gt; $t.get(`demo.tickets:Ticket#status`) == `demo.tickets:TicketStatus#open`)</rows>
							</table>
						</panel>
						<form input="ticket">
							<field attribute="name"/>
							<field attribute="status"/>
						</form>
					</stack>
				</tab>
				<tab id="marked"
					badge="marked"
					badge-role="success"
				>
					<label>
						<en>Marked</en>
						<de>Markiert</de>
					</label>
					<badge-label>
						<en>New entries</en>
						<de>Neue Einträge</de>
					</badge-label>
					<inset>
						<text>
							<label>
								<en>The dot at this tab shows while the checkbox above is checked.</en>
								<de>Der Punkt an diesem Reiter erscheint, solange das Kontrollkästchen oben angehakt ist.</de>
							</label>
						</text>
					</inset>
				</tab>
			</tab-bar>
		</stack>
	</panel>
</view>
